#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0810 expect=skipped domain=ADLBC
#note "BUCKET-3 VALUE HALF (Fix #331, M2-D24 ruling 2026-08-22). USUBJIDN is not declared. Requirements.Variables.All now names both USUBJID and USUBJIDN, so this value rule SKIPS with USUBJIDN named as the reason instead of firing on every populated USUBJID row (which is what the bare empty(USUBJIDN) would do under absent = all-missing, Fix #330). The absence itself is the presence sister CDISC-AD0810-A's one dataset-level finding. If this EXECUTES, the gate was removed -- escalate."
# Declared-tier scope: structure= states the ADaM data structure this minimal table stands for;
# #define is its mandatory carrier (ScenarioDeclaredScopeProvider.install).
#define standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC structure=BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015
---
